# Pure Real-World Catchment Map: Alptal & Erlenbach (Schwyz, Switzerland)
# 20 x 20 km (EPSG:2056, Center E=2697000 N=1212000)
# DEM: swisstopo swissALTI3D 0.5m LiDAR | Imagery: SWISSIMAGE DOP10 0.10m COG
# Adaptive Quadtree LOD 0..10 (down to 0.076 m/px in Erlenbach gauge core)
# Keys: Wheel=Zoom (adaptive LOD streaming), Right-Drag=Orbit, Middle-Drag=Pan, K=Cycle Contours (0/1/2), Home=Reset View
mode 3d
tab 0
draw 0
ground off
gimbal 1
hud 1
plot 0
text 0
terrain examples/demo/maps/alptal_ch.epack
contours 1
camera 0 -900 750 0.42 -0.82 0.055 1
